  {
    "title": "Architecture decision: database driver",
    "body": "## Context\n\nWe need to decide whether to stick with SQLite for production or move to PostgreSQL.\n\n## Options\n\n1. SQLite — zero config, single file\n2. PostgreSQL — better concurrency, horizontal scaling"
  }
}
